1
00:00:00,160 --> 00:00:01,470
Hum along with me...

2
00:00:01,470 --> 00:00:02,830
mmmmmmm...

3
00:00:02,830 --> 00:00:04,540
and pinch your nose.

4
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:05,485
Gone?

5
00:00:05,485 --> 00:00:06,630
You just locked your voice

6
00:00:06,630 --> 00:00:08,733
in a room with no door.

7
00:00:08,776 --> 00:00:09,988
A hum is air

8
00:00:09,988 --> 00:00:11,645
buzzing out your nose...

9
00:00:11,645 --> 00:00:12,670
lips shut.

10
00:00:12,670 --> 00:00:13,257
Pinch it,

11
00:00:13,257 --> 00:00:14,930
and that air piles up...

12
00:00:14,930 --> 00:00:16,161
cheeks puff...

13
00:00:16,161 --> 00:00:17,350
till it pushes back

14
00:00:17,350 --> 00:00:19,440
as hard as your lungs.

15
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,429
No flow...

16
00:00:20,429 --> 00:00:21,720
no buzz.

17
00:00:21,920 --> 00:00:22,730
Weirder?

18
00:00:22,730 --> 00:00:23,659
A hum airs out

19
00:00:23,659 --> 00:00:25,780
the hidden caves behind your face.

20
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:26,490
Breathing?

21
00:00:26,490 --> 00:00:27,996
Barely touches them.

22
00:00:28,116 --> 00:00:30,370
Your face wants an encore.

